1
00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:02,280
=You Alone Know Me=

2
00:00:02,280 --> 00:00:03,892
(From the Qimao novel "My Bestie's Icy
Dad Got Drunk and Wild After We Wed")

3
00:00:03,892 --> 00:00:04,920
(Written by Qiaoqiaojiang)

4
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:08,040
=Episode 19=

5
00:00:08,320 --> 00:00:09,000
Mrs. Xie,

6
00:00:09,480 --> 00:00:11,720
you've barely left your husband's bed,

7
00:00:12,679 --> 00:00:14,240
and you're going on a blind date
with another man?

8
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:17,199
No.

9
00:00:17,920 --> 00:00:19,280
Mrs. Wen doesn't know I'm married.

10
00:00:21,199 --> 00:00:23,280
She and Mr. Gu arranged it.

11
00:00:24,039 --> 00:00:25,879
I couldn't really let them...

12
00:00:34,119 --> 00:00:35,159
Who is your date?

13
00:00:37,679 --> 00:00:38,159
I don't know.

14
00:00:38,520 --> 00:00:39,159
Could you not go?

15
00:00:40,159 --> 00:00:43,240
It's hard to say no.

16
00:00:44,520 --> 00:00:45,200
Go get changed.

17
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:49,039
You're going on a blind date,
aren't you?

18
00:00:51,039 --> 00:00:51,640
Or

19
00:00:52,719 --> 00:00:53,759
are you going

20
00:00:53,880 --> 00:00:55,399
in pajamas that smell like me

21
00:00:56,119 --> 00:00:57,159
to meet another man?

22
00:00:57,520 --> 00:00:57,920
I...

23
00:01:16,799 --> 00:01:17,799
(I don't get it.)

24
00:01:18,760 --> 00:01:19,760
(He's even driving me)

25
00:01:19,840 --> 00:01:20,959
(to meet another man.)

26
00:01:21,760 --> 00:01:22,920
(What is he thinking?)

27
00:01:29,519 --> 00:01:30,200
I'm here.

28
00:01:31,180 --> 00:01:32,000
Okay.

29
00:02:20,400 --> 00:02:21,000
(Mrs. Wen,)

30
00:02:21,560 --> 00:02:22,400
(I'm at the restaurant.)

31
00:02:46,759 --> 00:02:47,759
Hello, Miss Lin.

32
00:02:48,120 --> 00:02:48,599
I'm Ling Hao.

33
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:49,719
Nice to meet you.

34
00:02:50,479 --> 00:02:51,280
Hello, Mr. Ling.

35
00:02:51,439 --> 00:02:52,039
I'm Lin Hua.

36
00:02:52,599 --> 00:02:53,000
Please sit.

37
00:03:09,800 --> 00:03:10,400
Miss Lin,

38
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:11,479
I know

39
00:03:12,039 --> 00:03:13,159
proposing at our first meeting

40
00:03:13,400 --> 00:03:13,879
is rather forward.

41
00:03:14,479 --> 00:03:15,280
But I still want to ask.

42
00:03:15,800 --> 00:03:16,639
Will you marry me

43
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:18,280
and become my wife?

44
00:03:19,080 --> 00:03:21,080
I think there's a misunderstanding.

45
00:03:21,400 --> 00:03:22,599
I'm not here to...

46
00:03:22,639 --> 00:03:23,199
I know.

47
00:03:23,479 --> 00:03:24,159
We've just met,

48
00:03:24,319 --> 00:03:25,639
and this may be too fast for you.

49
00:03:26,039 --> 00:03:28,319
But I like to be efficient.

50
00:03:30,840 --> 00:03:32,960
(Prenuptial Agreement)
I've drafted a prenup.

51
00:03:33,479 --> 00:03:35,120
See if you'd like any changes.

52
00:03:35,360 --> 00:03:36,280
We can talk it through.

53
00:03:37,919 --> 00:03:40,680
(I thought marrying Xie Zhouhan
after a blind date was fast.)

54
00:03:41,439 --> 00:03:43,039
(Ling Hao's even faster.)

55
00:03:54,280 --> 00:03:55,360
What a coincidence, Hua.

56
00:03:57,560 --> 00:03:58,360
I heard Mrs. Wen

57
00:03:58,400 --> 00:03:59,719
set you up with a blind date.

58
00:04:00,240 --> 00:04:01,400
So it's Mr. Ling.

59
00:04:02,439 --> 00:04:03,840
You really hit the jackpot.

60
00:04:04,479 --> 00:04:06,120
He's Lingyu Group's

61
00:04:06,240 --> 00:04:07,280
future boss.

62
00:04:07,759 --> 00:04:09,039
Just back from studying abroad.

63
00:04:09,520 --> 00:04:11,280
Young and successful.

64
00:04:11,560 --> 00:04:12,439
You're too kind, Miss Li.

65
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:13,680
Mr. Ling,

66
00:04:14,120 --> 00:04:15,000
you have no idea

67
00:04:15,120 --> 00:04:16,439
how accomplished Hua is.

68
00:04:17,319 --> 00:04:19,959
A top graduate of Jiangcheng University,

69
00:04:20,319 --> 00:04:21,879
just hired by S&D,

70
00:04:22,480 --> 00:04:24,800
and best friends

71
00:04:24,839 --> 00:04:25,920
with the Xie family's daughter.

72
00:04:26,519 --> 00:04:28,560
Her background isn't much, but...

73
00:04:28,560 --> 00:04:29,040
Enough.

74
00:04:29,519 --> 00:04:30,439
It's just a first meeting.

75
00:04:32,439 --> 00:04:34,199
Since you haven't eaten, join us.

76
00:04:34,800 --> 00:04:35,240
Mr. Ling,

77
00:04:35,839 --> 00:04:36,560
you don't mind, do you?

78
00:04:37,399 --> 00:04:39,000
I hear your engagement to Miss Li

79
00:04:39,040 --> 00:04:39,720
is all settled, Mr. Gu.

80
00:04:40,360 --> 00:04:42,160
When's the wedding?

81
00:04:43,879 --> 00:04:44,879
We haven't set a date.

82
00:04:45,439 --> 00:04:46,839
But it'll be a good one.

83
00:04:49,759 --> 00:04:51,000
Mr. Ling, you may not know,

84
00:04:51,959 --> 00:04:53,279
but my brother and his bride-to-be

85
00:04:53,480 --> 00:04:55,680
(Prenuptial Agreement)
are the golden couple of our circle.

86
00:04:55,680 --> 00:04:56,959
You should chat with them.

87
00:04:57,240 --> 00:04:58,720
Maybe you'll do business together.

88
00:05:01,680 --> 00:05:02,240
I'll leave you to it.

89
00:05:02,759 --> 00:05:03,279
I'm going.

90
00:05:04,079 --> 00:05:04,480
Lin Hua.

91
00:05:05,279 --> 00:05:05,680
Lin Hua!

92
00:05:09,000 --> 00:05:09,519
Excuse me.

93
00:05:09,780 --> 00:05:10,360
Sure.

94
00:05:14,240 --> 00:05:15,480
(Shihaiyue)

95
00:05:18,279 --> 00:05:18,680
You...

96
00:05:19,759 --> 00:05:20,160
You...

97
00:05:20,920 --> 00:05:22,399
Why are you still here?

98
00:05:22,639 --> 00:05:23,560
If I'd left,

99
00:05:24,519 --> 00:05:26,000
how would I know

100
00:05:26,079 --> 00:05:27,600
my wife was so faithful to me?

101
00:05:33,520 --> 00:05:35,040
♪Kiss me slower♪

102
00:05:35,040 --> 00:05:36,760
♪Come closer♪

103
00:05:38,280 --> 00:05:40,160
♪Not too close♪

104
00:05:40,160 --> 00:05:40,680
Why...

105
00:05:41,439 --> 00:05:43,279
Why are you staring at me?

106
00:05:44,600 --> 00:05:45,399
♪Stay there♪

107
00:05:45,399 --> 00:05:46,079
I'm happy.

108
00:05:48,959 --> 00:05:49,639
I'm happy

109
00:05:49,800 --> 00:05:52,000
my wife has principles and boundaries.

110
00:05:52,279 --> 00:05:53,199
Although that guy

111
00:05:53,360 --> 00:05:54,720
proposed the moment he met you,

112
00:05:55,720 --> 00:05:56,920
it just proves

113
00:05:58,160 --> 00:05:59,120
I have good taste.

114
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:02,360
Do you have super hearing?

115
00:06:02,480 --> 00:06:03,800
You heard everything we said?

116
00:06:06,920 --> 00:06:09,000
I was afraid someone might

117
00:06:09,240 --> 00:06:10,160
steal you away.

118
00:06:12,990 --> 00:06:16,258
♪Kiss me slower slower♪

119
00:06:16,282 --> 00:06:19,023
♪Slower than before♪

120
00:06:19,508 --> 00:06:22,590
♪Give me one take♪

121
00:06:22,636 --> 00:06:24,980
♪Just a little more♪

122
00:06:25,910 --> 00:06:28,254
♪Touch my lips♪

123
00:06:28,278 --> 00:06:31,411
♪Then call my name♪
(Signature page, Party A Xie Zhouhan)

124
00:06:32,269 --> 00:06:35,329
♪Kiss me slower slower♪

125
00:06:36,353 --> 00:06:39,760
♪Make me wake♪

126
00:06:40,867 --> 00:06:43,557
♪Your hand is in my hand♪

127
00:06:43,582 --> 00:06:46,342
♪My back against the wall♪

128
00:06:47,018 --> 00:06:49,797
♪You stop before the kiss♪

129
00:06:49,821 --> 00:06:51,622
♪And I forget it all♪

130
00:06:52,411 --> 00:06:55,003
♪Stay close♪

131
00:06:55,305 --> 00:06:58,456
♪I need it♪

132
00:06:58,613 --> 00:07:01,400
♪One breath♪

133
00:07:01,789 --> 00:07:03,246
♪Not yet♪

134
00:07:03,270 --> 00:07:04,307
♪Now♪

135
00:07:04,331 --> 00:07:07,500
♪Kiss me slower slower♪

136
00:07:07,525 --> 00:07:09,994
♪Slower than before♪

137
00:07:10,677 --> 00:07:13,781
♪Give me one take♪

138
00:07:13,805 --> 00:07:16,828
♪Just a little more♪

139
00:07:16,852 --> 00:07:19,199
♪Touch my lips♪

140
00:07:19,639 --> 00:07:23,326
♪Then call my name♪

141
00:07:23,628 --> 00:07:26,705
♪Kiss me slower slower♪

142
00:07:27,219 --> 00:07:30,830
♪Make me wake♪

143
00:07:31,852 --> 00:07:33,463
♪No words♪

144
00:07:33,487 --> 00:07:35,187
♪No hurry♪

145
00:07:35,211 --> 00:07:36,791
♪Your mouth♪

146
00:07:36,815 --> 00:07:38,260
♪So close to mine♪

147
00:07:38,284 --> 00:07:39,807
♪One kiss♪

148
00:07:39,831 --> 00:07:41,831
♪Then another♪
